Third-party software in this toolchain
======================================

The licence texts are in LICENSES/ (and, for the bundled C toolchain, in
cc/LICENSES/).

Linked into the binaries wiz, grail and tower (built with Lean 4):

* The Lean 4 runtime and standard library (Init, Std, Lean): Apache License 2.0.
  LICENSES/lean4-LICENSE.
* mimalloc (Lean's allocator): MIT. LICENSES/mimalloc-LICENSE.
* libuv 1.x (Lean's event loop), statically: MIT. LICENSES/libuv-LICENSE.
* libc++ and libc++abi (LLVM), statically: Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions.
  LICENSES/lean4-third-party (the licences of what Lean's binary releases bundle).
* GNU MP (GMP) 6.3.0, statically: GNU LGPL v3 or later, or GNU GPL v2 or later.
  LICENSES/lean4-third-party (the LGPL v3) and LICENSE (the GPL v3, which the LGPL
